&ERROR &EXIT &RETCODE
&CONTROL ERROR MSG
&IF &INDEX > 0 &IF &1 ¬= * &GOTO -SPEC
         CPWLVL STACK
         &READ VARS &X &CNTRL
         &ARGS &CNTRL &2 &3 &4 &5 &6 &7
-SPEC
*
STATE &1 CNTRL *
*
&CONTROL OFF
&ERROR &CONTINUE
CP SET RUN ON
&IF &$ EQ TEST CP SET RUN OFF
*
CP DEFINE READER 099
CP CLOSE 099 HOLD
CP SPOOL 099 CLASS I HOLD
CP PURGE READER CLASS I
CP PURGE READER CLASS L
CP SPOOL PUNCH TO * CLASS I NOHOLD PURGE
CP SPOOL PRINTER TO * CLASS L

&ERROR &EXIT &RETCODE
VMFLOAD CPWATCH &1

CP SPOOL PUNCH OFF CLASS A

&CONTROL ALL
CP IPL 099 CLEAR
&EXIT 0 (HAH).
